&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Evangelism:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion Fin&#39;s product by driving its adoption and growth within the Mid-Market and Enterprise segment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Cycle Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the complete new business sales cycle for Mid-Market/Enterprise customers, from initial outbound to closing deals, utilising a consultative values based sales approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Generation: &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure at least 40% of total qualified pipeline value is sourced through outbound activity, measured quarterly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver accurate sales forecasts and provide clear visibility on revenue performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain comprehensive and up-to-date knowledge of our evolving products and sales processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Demonstrations:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and present customized product demonstrations to meet specific client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Engage in mentoring and development activities within the sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent the voice of the customer to internal stakeholders, including Marketing and Product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling, tailored product demonstrations and business cases based on customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
