&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven success in meeting and exceeding sales quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong ability to navigate and solve challenges in a fast-paced environment, handling both inbound and outbound opportunities across various industries and company sizes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have: &lt;/strong&gt;Speak Mandarin &amp;amp; sold into HongKong, Singapore &amp;amp; Malaysia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to close net new business in a competitive landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Exhibits intellectual curiosity, ambition, and a continuous learning attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
